 Our first tranche of Future of Defense Summit speakers has been announced. Check them out, and request an invite to attend, here . More coming soon — including uniformed folks. ☢️ Situational awareness: President Trump wants to hold a trilateral summit with China's Xi Jinping and Russia's Vladimir Putin to discuss denuclearization, my colleague Barak Ravid reported.

 On the move: Lessons from the underground, Stars and Stripes switch-ups and Aevex air-launch intrigue.

 Today's newsletter is 1,811 words, a 7-minute read. 

 
 
